Package: DietCali
Title: FFQ to FNDDS Diet Calibration and Dietary Index Pipeline
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Maps FFQ items to USDA FNDDS foods, derives gram weights and
    daily intakes, and calculates dietary indexes (HEI, MIND).
    This file only declares R dependencies; install them with
    remotes::install_deps(dependencies = TRUE).
License: None (internal research project)
Encoding: UTF-8
